# {{title}} QA evidence

Run the [web standards](../../../methods/quality/web-standards.md), the
[web QA checklist](../../../methods/quality/web-qa-checklist.md) and the
[launch-readiness checklist](../../../methods/quality/launch-readiness-checklist.md)
against the production build. Record results as text here. Screenshots,
recordings and traces stay in the vault under `{{codename}}/files/qa/`;
reference them by filename. Staging and production URLs are vault-only.

